# Run outputs derived from InteriorGS stay out of git (hear-lab/data/README.md, the user's answer of 2026-11-24;
# hear-lab/STANDARDS.md "Results storage"). Everything is ignored except the files listed below. Folders are
# un-ignored so git can reach the listed files. Do not force-add anything.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
# sha256 manifest of every file of a run, committed or not
!*/manifest.sha256
# run settings, per-episode tallies (ids, counts, timing), summary and verdict, preflight (free field, no scene data)
!*/render/run_config.json
!*/render/episode_records.jsonl
!*/render/timing.json
!*/render/preflight.json
!*/render/summary.json
!*/render/episode_tallies.csv
# pose export settings, ids, frame counts and timing; alignment against route A check 2's videos
!*/export/export_meta.json
!*/export/alignment.json
# environment lists, parquet hash, scene and alignment id lists
!*/env/*.txt
!*/env/*.sha256
# NOT listed (local only): export/poses/ (scene coordinates), export/videos/ (renders), render/episodes/ (per-step
# records with coordinates, impulse responses, box-derived values), render/clips/ (rendered audio), render/topdown/
# (pictures), logs, inputs/ (the third-party telephone ring).
